1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,373
- There you are!

2
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:08,660
Hello? Anyone home?

3
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,164
Is anybody here?

4
00:00:10,164 --> 00:00:11,414
Anybody? Hello?

5
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:20,500
Anybody here!?

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,150
- Yes, stop shouting, I'm on the roof.

7
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:24,263
What do you want?

8
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:26,863
Why don't you come up?

9
00:00:31,756 --> 00:00:32,684
(Kiki gasping)

10
00:00:32,684 --> 00:00:35,434
(bird squawking)

11
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,240
What do you want?

12
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:43,650
- Oh, well, you have a black
cat in your cabin window

13
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:45,923
and you see, it's mine and I need it back.

14
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,590
- You're a good birdie, aren't you?

15
00:00:52,144 --> 00:00:52,977
(bird chirping)

16
00:00:52,977 --> 00:00:54,430
So why was it alone in the forest, huh?

17
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:56,020
- That's where I dropped it.

18
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,370
May I have it back, please?

19
00:00:58,230 --> 00:01:02,140
- I really need to finish this.

20
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,403
That's my girl.

21
00:01:04,470 --> 00:01:06,832
You're just about through, okay.

22
00:01:06,832 --> 00:01:09,640
(bird squawking)

23
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,749
(pencil scraping)

24
00:01:11,749 --> 00:01:12,582
- Oooh.

25
00:01:15,830 --> 00:01:17,150
- Well, why didn't you tell me sooner

26
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:18,850
why you needed it in such a hurry?

27
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:21,920
He keeps me company.

28
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,380
I've gotten sort of fond of him, you know?

29
00:01:23,380 --> 00:01:24,804
- Thank you.

30
00:01:24,804 --> 00:01:29,804
(Kiki gasping) Oh no,
his head's falling off.

31
00:01:29,850 --> 00:01:31,100
- Ooh, it must've been the crows.

32
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:32,980
They were making such a big fuss over him.

33
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:34,020
- This is terrible.

34
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:36,040
I can't deliver it like this.

35
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:36,873
- Hmm.

36
00:01:38,010 --> 00:01:41,143
Hey, I know. How about we work out a deal?

37
00:01:41,143 --> 00:01:41,976
- Huh?

38
00:01:43,437 --> 00:01:45,570
- So, you're on your own at 13.

39
00:01:45,570 --> 00:01:46,890
That's pretty exciting,

40
00:01:46,890 --> 00:01:50,190
to be completely independent
and a witch, impressive.

41
00:01:50,190 --> 00:01:51,270
- How's it going?

42
00:01:51,270 --> 00:01:53,533
- Trust me, he'll be good as new. Huh.

43
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:56,083
Almost done.

